{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an ambitious archaeologist discovers a map to a forgotten island, you \u2014 the ship\u2019s mechanic \u2014 are dragged into a voyage into the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOREOGRAPHED EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/24a3c0d3570f4a9599b1cc338633e09b.poster.avif?t=1759351854\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/24a3c0d3570f4a9599b1cc338633e09b.webm?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/24a3c0d3570f4a9599b1cc338633e09b.mp4?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world where the story unfolds around you in real-time through scripted events. No cutscenes, no interruptions\u2014just you in control. Dive into conversations, eavesdrop, or walk away\u2014it's your call.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICAL INTERACTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/611184a6148557d0c048acaa27a1e154.poster.avif?t=1759351854\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/611184a6148557d0c048acaa27a1e154.webm?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/611184a6148557d0c048acaa27a1e154.mp4?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world naturally, pulling, pushing, and grabbing. Every action feels tactile, opening the door to immersive and quirky gameplay moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/2f1ea2febc51378e5f24c3dec7b97766.poster.avif?t=1759351854\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/2f1ea2febc51378e5f24c3dec7b97766.webm?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/extras/2f1ea2febc51378e5f24c3dec7b97766.mp4?t=1759351854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a meticulously crafted environment. PSX-ish style visuals, rich soundscapes and sound effects bring every moment to life.\u00a0Hear sounds change as you move, get muffled behind walls, or echo in certain spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contextual dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime choreographed cutscenes and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive volumetric audio</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now to get updates and be the first to experience the haunting mystery when it releases!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3212260?t=1759351854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/491388747864791a0932ef41148f0910e7b21b3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759351854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212260/46172862291e4987a1eb4f2dd29de99a71b9177c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759351854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam